COMPILATION OF: E46M27

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46M27

   1 a 0000 E46M27:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2b] RUNTIME: ONE multi-item file PUT and the SAME items
   4 a 0006      as separate single-item PUTs, written to ONE file in sequence.
   5 a 0006      [C295] measured one BLANK between items of SEPARATE statements
   6 a 0006      and no line terminator; nothing has measured the separator
   7 a 0006      BETWEEN ITEMS OF ONE STATEMENT. If it belongs to the statement
   8 a 0006      the two halves differ; if it belongs to the item they are
   9 a 0006      identical. */
  10 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying, w char(20) varying;
  11 c 0006   v = 'HELLO';
  12 c 0013   w = 'XY';
  13 c 0020   open file(outf) stream output title('M27OUT DAT');
  14 c 003D   put file(outf) list(v,w);
  15 c 005E   put file(outf) list(v);
  16 c 0076   put file(outf) list(w);
  17 c 008E   put file(outf) list(v,w);
  18 c 00AF   close file(outf);
  19 c 00B5   put list('DONE');
  20 c 00CC   stop;
  21 a 00CF end E46M27;

CODE SIZE = 00CF
DATA AREA = 003F
FREE SYMS = 3848
END  COMPILATION
